{
 "notes": {
  "what": "Every scheduler configuration of the lease campaign (tools/campaign.py documents the format). A configuration id is <family>.<system>.<knob>; the lease rows in configs/scope.json pick which ones run.",
  "weights": "The eight RouteBalance weight vectors of the v3 grid (p1_pareto.sh RB_WEIGHTS), each summing to 1 exactly: uniform is 1/3 each (v3's 0.33 summed to 0.99, which the config now rejects).",
  "rb": "rb = the G1 candidate default (D16): profiled TPOT(running batch) + batch_aware envelope + fixed_ref normalization. rb-static = the v3-like static arm: constant TPOT + queue_aware + max_divide (plan section 1 ablations). Both read the W1 table (D37: one calibration run gives the curve and the constant).",
  "ablations": "abl-* are W4's arms (D41), each the rb configuration with the one change its name says (and only what that change forces): lpt-off; round1 / round32 (fixed rounds); xgb (the learned heads retrained on the W1b sweep; the xgboost source pairs only with queue_aware); wlat0 (v2 arm 2: w_latency = 0, the reactive shortest-queue tie-break); static-prior (v2 arm 4: constant TPOT x own length, queue-blind); prompt-blind (per-model mean prior, D10); half-labels (the 50%-label KNN index); dr-off (dead reckoning off); maxdiv (the normalization arm: the curve with max_divide); wq0 / wc0 (per-term drops). Dropped weights are rescaled so the rest sum to 1, which leaves every argmax unchanged. v2's arm 3 (w_latency = 0 with a predictive argmin tie-break) has no configuration: the rebuilt tie-break is fixed (D35). const-batch is the D45 control (constant TPOT in the batch_aware envelope), run only if the owner decides so. abl-lpt-min / abl-lpt-mean are W11 (LPT key min / mean, D41; the configuration accepts them from S5b on). Each template's ablates lists the manifest paths its arm changes from the rb reference (the parity gate checks it differs in exactly those).",
  "baselines": "AvengersPro: beta 5.0, top_k 4 (Qwen artifacts) / 3 (Gemma), the MiniLM embedder at the pinned revision (the same as the KNN encoder's), the upstream checkout pinned by digest (dfb60b1 plus the local patch that makes its training-only datasets import optional). BEST-Route: thresholds 0 (argmax) / 0.3 / 0.5 / 0.7, fallback Qwen2.5-3B as in v3 (payloads_v3.sh), max_length 512; Qwen only (no Gemma checkpoint). Dispatchers: round robin, power of two, least outstanding (= shortest queue under exact in-flight accounting, D40), random, lowest_latency with LiteLLM's 10-sample window (D25). Ties go to the least recently used instance (D35, in the code).",
  "telemetry": "How each system reads load (telemetry_read; D53, D54, D55). RouteBalance fetches every instance once per batch (per_round); the pipeline systems read the background pollers' cache (poll, D19, dead reckoning on). G1's controls: rb-poll and rb-static-poll are RouteBalance on the same pollers' cache (D54); rb-dec-probe and ap.<pw>.lor-probe are v3's per-request baselines, which fetch the router's candidates for every request and read the engine's own running + waiting (dead reckoning off; least outstanding is then v3's shortest queue, D55).",
  "sweep": "sweep.random is the W1b latency sweep (D38): passthrough router, random dispatch over every instance, pending_decode own_length, so the server writes latency.<digest>.jsonl. Its estimator (parts.estimator.sweep) is the owner's: the sweep sends training-split prompts, and the main KNN index holds every one of them, so its neighbours would include each prompt itself (weight ~1e6 at distance 0) and the logged lengths would be near-exact, unlike at serving on evaluation prompts (a train/serve skew for the learned heads, D38/D43). Options: the main index anyway, or an index built without the sweep's prompts.",
  "decoupled": "RB-decoupled follows the RouteBalance arm it is the control of (same predictors, plan section 1): rb-dec uses the curve arm's latency, rb-static-dec the static arm's; the main grid runs <rb_default>-dec.",
  "pipeline": "In a pipeline configuration the RouteBalance-only keys (rounds, lpt, and for AvengersPro, BEST-Route and dispatcher rows the estimator and latency) are inert: the scheduler does not load or read them. They still enter the configuration digest, so they name the deployment's own artifacts.",
  "budget": "budget.off: admission_filter false in every configuration; its confidence (0.5) is then read by nothing. The budget sweep (W7b) is disabled: the benchmark client sends no per-request budget yet.",
  "owner": "Owner values (09-25): telemetry poll_ms / max_age_ms / timeout_s = 50 / 500 / 1.0 (D30); RouteBalance pending_decode = own_length (D31); dispatcher seed 1 (v3's po2 seed); the fixed 32-request round's timeout 200 ms (the adaptive rule pairs 32 with 200 ms). Still OWNER-MUST-SET: the W1b sweep estimator (estimator.sweep)",
  "pins": "$pin names come from the lease (tools/campaign.py render --pins): knn.<family> and knn-half.<family> (index dir + md5), tpot-table.<family> (the W1 calibration table + md5), xgb-heads.<family> (the W1b-trained heads dir + the md5 of its md5s.json), ap.<family>.<pw> (artifact dir), br.<family> (checkpoint dir)."
 },
 "lists": {
  "all_families": ["qwen", "gemma"],
  "qwen_only": ["qwen"],
  "rb_weights": ["q10l10c80", "q10l80c10", "q20l20c60", "q20l60c20", "uniform", "q50l30c20", "q60l20c20", "q80l10c10"],
  "ap_pw": ["pw025", "pw039", "pw053", "pw070", "pw080"],
  "br_t": ["t00", "t03", "t05", "t07"],
  "routed_dispatch": ["lor", "rr", "po2"],
  "dispatchers": ["rr", "po2", "lor", "random", "lowest-latency"]
 },
 "parts": {
  "weights.q10l10c80": {"w_quality": 0.1, "w_latency": 0.1, "w_cost": 0.8},
  "weights.q10l80c10": {"w_quality": 0.1, "w_latency": 0.8, "w_cost": 0.1},
  "weights.q20l20c60": {"w_quality": 0.2, "w_latency": 0.2, "w_cost": 0.6},
  "weights.q20l60c20": {"w_quality": 0.2, "w_latency": 0.6, "w_cost": 0.2},
  "weights.uniform": {"w_quality": 0.3333333333333333, "w_latency": 0.3333333333333333, "w_cost": 0.3333333333333333},
  "weights.q50l30c20": {"w_quality": 0.5, "w_latency": 0.3, "w_cost": 0.2},
  "weights.q60l20c20": {"w_quality": 0.6, "w_latency": 0.2, "w_cost": 0.2},
  "weights.q80l10c10": {"w_quality": 0.8, "w_latency": 0.1, "w_cost": 0.1},

  "rounds.adaptive": {"adaptive": true, "max_batch": null, "timeout_ms": null},
  "rounds.fixed1": {"adaptive": false, "max_batch": 1, "timeout_ms": 50.0},
  "rounds.fixed32": {"adaptive": false, "max_batch": 32, "timeout_ms": 200.0},
  "telemetry": {"poll_ms": 50.0, "max_age_ms": 500.0, "timeout_s": 1.0},
  "budget.off": {"admission_filter": false, "confidence": 0.5},
  "rb.pending_decode": "own_length",

  "encoder_revision": "1110a243fdf4706b3f48f1d95db1a4f5529b4d41",
  "estimator.knn": {"index_dir": "$pin:knn.{family}:path", "index_md5": "$pin:knn.{family}:md5",
                    "encoder_revision": "$part:encoder_revision", "k": 50, "score_type": "deepeval", "prior": "knn"},
  "estimator.prompt_blind": {"index_dir": "$pin:knn.{family}:path", "index_md5": "$pin:knn.{family}:md5",
                             "encoder_revision": "$part:encoder_revision", "k": 50, "score_type": "deepeval",
                             "prior": "per_model_mean"},
  "estimator.sweep": "OWNER-MUST-SET",
  "estimator.half_labels": {"index_dir": "$pin:knn-half.{family}:path", "index_md5": "$pin:knn-half.{family}:md5",
                            "encoder_revision": "$part:encoder_revision", "k": 50, "score_type": "deepeval",
                            "prior": "knn"},

  "latency.curve": {"source": "profiled_curve", "envelope": "batch_aware", "normalization": "fixed_ref",
                    "table": "$pin:tpot-table.{family}:path", "table_md5": "$pin:tpot-table.{family}:md5"},
  "latency.static": {"source": "constant", "envelope": "queue_aware", "normalization": "max_divide",
                     "table": "$pin:tpot-table.{family}:path", "table_md5": "$pin:tpot-table.{family}:md5"},
  "latency.curve_maxdiv": {"source": "profiled_curve", "envelope": "batch_aware", "normalization": "max_divide",
                           "table": "$pin:tpot-table.{family}:path", "table_md5": "$pin:tpot-table.{family}:md5"},
  "latency.static_prior": {"source": "constant", "envelope": "own_length", "normalization": "fixed_ref",
                           "table": "$pin:tpot-table.{family}:path", "table_md5": "$pin:tpot-table.{family}:md5"},
  "latency.const_batch": {"source": "constant", "envelope": "batch_aware", "normalization": "fixed_ref",
                          "table": "$pin:tpot-table.{family}:path", "table_md5": "$pin:tpot-table.{family}:md5"},
  "latency.xgb": {"source": "xgboost", "envelope": "queue_aware", "normalization": "fixed_ref",
                  "table": "$pin:xgb-heads.{family}:path", "table_md5": "$pin:xgb-heads.{family}:md5"},

  "dispatch.seed": 1,
  "dispatch.lor": {"type": "least_outstanding", "seed": "$part:dispatch.seed", "latency_window": null},
  "dispatch.rr": {"type": "round_robin", "seed": "$part:dispatch.seed", "latency_window": null},
  "dispatch.po2": {"type": "po2", "seed": "$part:dispatch.seed", "latency_window": null},
  "dispatch.random": {"type": "random", "seed": "$part:dispatch.seed", "latency_window": null},
  "dispatch.lowest-latency": {"type": "lowest_latency", "seed": "$part:dispatch.seed", "latency_window": 10},

  "ap.top_k.qwen": 4,
  "ap.top_k.gemma": 3,
  "ap.router": {"type": "avengers_pro", "kwargs": {"artifact_dir": "$pin:ap.{family}.{pw}:path", "beta": 5.0,
                "top_k": "$part:ap.top_k.{family}", "embedder": "sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",
                "embedder_revision": "$part:encoder_revision",
                "upstream_sha256": "6cfaf58f525217b47c2e90361fbb3e94309f66fbbc7eadef067e01c82946493b"}},
  "br.threshold.t00": 0.0,
  "br.threshold.t03": 0.3,
  "br.threshold.t05": 0.5,
  "br.threshold.t07": 0.7,
  "br.fallback.qwen": "Qwen/Qwen2.5-3B",
  "br.router": {"type": "best_route", "kwargs": {"checkpoint": "$pin:br.{family}:path",
                "confidence_threshold": "$part:br.threshold.{t}", "fallback_model": "$part:br.fallback.{family}",
                "max_length": 512}}
 },
